#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2219 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "STYPE/INTERVENTIONAL present and a TRT record present -> $trt_count=1 -> silent. (The space-bearing value 'DRUG A' appears only in a data cell, never in a pin.)"
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSPARM   type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
---
S1 | TS | 1 | STYPE | Study Type                         | INTERVENTIONAL
S1 | TS | 2 | TRT   | Investigational Therapy or Treatment | DRUG A
